    "name": "Iron Rain",
    "steam_appid": 3522560,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iron Rain is a race to carnage! As an AI Tank Commander you battle the Nirvana AI and her robot hordes, in this Speedy Twin-Stick Roguelike. Grow overpowered with a vast range of upgrades against a varied and unique army of enemies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Playable Characters, each with different effects on gameplay and a Story Sequence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Stages with a 3-phase expanding map, adaptive soundtrack and a Unique Stage Boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >34 Unique Upgrades with 5-10 levels of power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >26 Achievements, each contributing uniquely to meta-progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Unique Mini-bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 Unique non-Boss Enemies with unique behaviour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple variations of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 Unique pickups</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Setting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the distant future, the rogue AI Nirvana, has completed her domination of the planet. In a desperate move, the now late Professor Cera launched her final initiative: Iron Rain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iron Rain, is a series of highly extremely advanced armoured assault vehicles: Shire, Quarter, Morgan and Thoroughbred. Piloted by her records of her old strike team. Captain Minnie, Captain Sadie, Captain Cera, herself, and a stranger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iron Rain is playable via Keyboard + Mouse, or via Controller as a twin stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Iron Rain, after selecting a character and a stage, you will be faced with a racetrack and a growing horde of enemies. Completing laps of the track will expand it, and increase the enemy onslaught, spawning mini-bosses, and eventually the Stage Boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To help you defeat these bosses you will destroy enemies for a variety of upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522560/extras/48d65fe5cd869d5c8591b33bbd1ad6a9.poster.avif?t=1746750913\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522560/extras/48d65fe5cd869d5c8591b33bbd1ad6a9.webm?t=1746750913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522560/extras/48d65fe5cd869d5c8591b33bbd1ad6a9.mp4?t=1746750913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll reach binding speeds using these upgrades to destroy enemies in your wake !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522560/extras/c8b03153ab21093d3bb86a1de625910f.poster.avif?t=1746750913\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522560/extras/c8b03153ab21093d3bb86a1de625910f.webm?t=1746750913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522560/extras/c8b03153ab21093d3bb86a1de625910f.mp4?t=1746750913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll collect up to 16 items at a time and take the fight to the devastating Stage Boss's and their hordes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522560/extras/03791337d35e269b4870f5bd78fd46e8.poster.avif?t=1746750913\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522560/extras/03791337d35e269b4870f5bd78fd46e8.webm?t=1746750913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522560/extras/03791337d35e269b4870f5bd78fd46e8.mp4?t=1746750913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each victory or defeat your methods of destruction will unlock more upgrades, more stages and the other Playable Characters, expanding the variety of your carnage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iron Rain is a race to carnage! As an AI Tank Commander you battle the Nirvana AI and her robot hordes, in this Speedy Twin-Stick Roguelike. Grow overpowered with a vast range of upgrades against a varied and unique army of enemies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Playable Characters, each with different effects on gameplay and a Story Sequence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Stages with a 3-phase expanding map, adaptive soundtrack and a Unique Stage Boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >34 Unique Upgrades with 5-10 levels of power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >26 Achievements, each contributing uniquely to meta-progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Unique Mini-bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 Unique non-Boss Enemies with unique behaviour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple variations of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 Unique pickups</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Setting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the distant future, the rogue AI Nirvana, has completed her domination of the planet. In a desperate move, the now late Professor Cera launched her final initiative: Iron Rain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iron Rain, is a series of highly extremely advanced armoured assault vehicles: Shire, Quarter, Morgan and Thoroughbred. Piloted by her records of her old strike team. Captain Minnie, Captain Sadie, Captain Cera, herself, and a stranger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iron Rain is playable via Keyboard + Mouse, or via Controller as a twin stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Iron Rain, after selecting a character and a stage, you will be faced with a racetrack and a growing horde of enemies. Completing laps of the track will expand it, and increase the enemy onslaught, spawning mini-bosses, and eventually the Stage Boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To help you defeat these bosses you will destroy enemies for a variety of upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522560/extras/48d65fe5cd869d5c8591b33bbd1ad6a9.poster.avif?t=1746750913\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522560/extras/48d65fe5cd869d5c8591b33bbd1ad6a9.webm?t=1746750913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522560/extras/48d65fe5cd869d5c8591b33bbd1ad6a9.mp4?t=1746750913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll reach binding speeds using these upgrades to destroy enemies in your wake !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522560/extras/c8b03153ab21093d3bb86a1de625910f.poster.avif?t=1746750913\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522560/extras/c8b03153ab21093d3bb86a1de625910f.webm?t=1746750913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522560/extras/c8b03153ab21093d3bb86a1de625910f.mp4?t=1746750913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll collect up to 16 items at a time and take the fight to the devastating Stage Boss's and their hordes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522560/extras/03791337d35e269b4870f5bd78fd46e8.poster.avif?t=1746750913\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522560/extras/03791337d35e269b4870f5bd78fd46e8.webm?t=1746750913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522560/extras/03791337d35e269b4870f5bd78fd46e8.mp4?t=1746750913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each victory or defeat your methods of destruction will unlock more upgrades, more stages and the other Playable Characters, expanding the variety of your carnage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
